    "regime_notes": "Asynchronous-calendar validation with no forward filling and at least 8 valid instruments per date. Daily IC is positive in 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2025 and 2026; it was negative in 2024, so uncertainty is material in the 15-asset cross-section. The 0.25 trend weight passed the daily admission gate; neighboring weights 0.10, 0.15 and 0.20 also passed, while 0.50 failed ICIR."
